Description: Nim programming language
 Statically typed compiled systems programming language. This build runs
 on-device on rootless jailbreaks. posix_spawn/execve retry EPERM via
 /var/jb/bin/sh (no libiosexec). Signed with ldid using
 /var/jb/usr/share/nim/entitlements.plist after every link.
